node_modules/
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
*.log
.DS_Store
engine-scratch-*/
corpus/report.md
target/
# A workspace-local npm cache, used when the default cache is unwritable (a confined session)
.npm-cache/
# What `test-package.mjs` unpacks the tarball into; it is removed in a `finally`, and ignored in case a run is killed
.package-check/
# `npm pack` output, kept beside the repository so a profile can install from a path that survives a temp cleanup
*.tgz
# Kept as local working notes only; the published repository carries README and LICENSE
docs/
# Scratch for gate runs on a machine whose checkout carries the sandbox's Low label: the engine can only
# write inside that tree, so TMP/$TEMP are pointed here.
.tmp-run/
